#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: woo-product-sync-manager.php
msgid "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: woo-product-sync-manager.php
msgid "https://github.com/3agApp/ProductSyncManager"
msgstr "https://github.com/3agApp/ProductSyncManager"

#. Description of the plugin
#: woo-product-sync-manager.php
msgid "Shows the marketplace orders Product Sync Manager imports from Nalda and Temu: an orders column, an order panel, the delivery status the marketplace is sent, a delivery note, and no customer emails."
msgstr "Zeigt die Marktplatz-Bestellungen, die Product Sync Manager von Nalda und Temu importiert: eine Spalte in der Bestellliste, ein Bestellpanel, den Lieferstatus für den Marktplatz, einen Lieferschein – und keine Kunden-E-Mails."

